tus="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HIRAI, YUICHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KAWAI, CHIE</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MIKAMI, KOUICHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MIYAHARA, MIHO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MOCHIDUKI, YOUICHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NAKAGAWA, HIROKI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SEKINO, HITOSHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YAMADA, KAZUKI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YAMASHITA, RIKIYA</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YAMASHITA, TAKANORI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A lithium cell comprises a bag (4) for packaging a cell and a lithium cell body (2) contained in the bag (4). The bag (4) is made of a material being a laminate (10) for packaging a cell. The laminate (10) is made up of an outermost layer (11), a barrier layer (12), and an innermost layer (14), or made up of an outermost layer (11), a barrier layer (12), an intermediate layer (13), and an innermost layer (14). The innermost layer (11) is made of a moldable basic material, the barrier layer (12) is made of a gas barrier material, the intermediate layer (13) is made of a moldable basic material, and the innermost layer (14) is made of a thermal adhesion basic material.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne une pile au lithium logée dans un sachet de transport (4) et un corps (2) de pile au lithium contenu dans un sachet (4) qui est fait d'un matériau sous forme de feuille (10) permettant d'envelopper une pile. La feuille (10) est faite d'une couche externe (11), d'une couche barrière (12) et d'une couche interne (14) ou d'une couche externe (11), d'une couche barrière (12), d'une couche intermédiaire (13) et d'une couche interne (12). La couche interne (11) se compose d'une matière de base moulable, la couche barrière (12) se compose d'une matière barrière gazeuse, la couche intermédiaire (13) se compose d'une matière de base moulable et la couche interne (14) se compose d'une matière de base thermoadhésive.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>